note as BIZ_diagram_49_crm
  BUSINESS PURPOSE
  The internal CRM the clients asked for: a first-class contact and company (account)
  database, lead capture and qualification, sales/partnership pipelines with stages and
  opportunities, a logged activity timeline (calls, emails, meetings, notes, tasks), and a
  dedicated partnerships/alliances registry that ties commercial relationships to formal
  contracts (module 38 ERP) and advertising partners (module 43 ads). This is the
  commercial system-of-record for the operator, kept separate from clinical patient data.
end note

