note as DEP_diagram_49_crm
  Connects to other modules via:
  directory.tenants, iam.users, erp.contracts (partnerships/agreements), ads.ad_partners,
  consent.consents (contacts.marketing_consent_id), common.files, marketing.campaigns
  (leads.campaign_ref_id), directory.tenants (crm_accounts.linked_tenant_id links a CRM
  account to a real platform organization), terminology.catalog_concepts.
end note

note as PHI_BOUNDARY_diagram_49_crm
  COMMERCIAL, NOT CLINICAL. CRM stores commercial contacts/companies. When a contact maps
  to a real patient/practitioner it references the profile by id (linked_profile_ref) — it
  does NOT copy clinical data. Marketing outreach requires consent (do_not_contact / consent).
end note

note as REC_DERIVED_diagram_49_crm
  REC 3.3 — DERIVED
  opportunities.probability_percent may default from its stage; forecast rollups and
  lead_score are DERIVED/recomputed. leads.converted_opportunity_id is set on conversion.
end note

note as HARDENING_diagram_49_crm
  REC 3.4 — HARDENING (enforce at DDL)
  - contact_channels: partial UNIQUE(contact_id, channel_type_concept_id) WHERE is_primary.
  - pipeline_stages: UNIQUE(pipeline_id, code); exactly one is_won and one is_lost per pipeline (trigger).
  - opportunities: CHECK probability_percent BETWEEN 0 AND 100.
  - partnerships/partnership_agreements: (partner_ref_type,partner_ref_id) polymorphic -> value_set + trigger.
  - contacts.linked_profile_ref / crm_accounts.linked_org_ref polymorphic -> value_set + trigger.
end note

note as VALUE_SETS_diagram_49_crm
  VALUE SETS (bind *_concept_id; do not hardcode)
  account_type->vs_crm_account_type{prospect,customer,partner,supplier,insurer,pharmacy,hospital};
  contact_type->vs_contact_type{lead,customer,partner,influencer,staff};
  lifecycle_stage->vs_lifecycle_stage{subscriber,lead,mql,sql,opportunity,customer,evangelist};
  channel_type->vs_contact_channel{email,phone,mobile,whatsapp,linkedin,address};
  opt_in_status->vs_opt_in{unknown,opted_in,opted_out};
  lead_source/source->vs_lead_source{web,referral,event,ad,partner,inbound_call,import};
  lead_status->vs_lead_status{new,working,nurturing,qualified,unqualified,converted};
  pipeline_type->vs_pipeline_type{sales,partnership,onboarding,renewal};
  activity_type->vs_activity_type{call,email,meeting,note,task,whatsapp,demo};
  direction->vs_direction{inbound,outbound,internal};
  outcome->vs_activity_outcome{connected,no_answer,scheduled,completed,declined};
  partnership_type->vs_partnership_type{reseller,referral,integration,sponsorship,alliance,affiliate};
  tier->vs_partner_tier{bronze,silver,gold,platinum};
  agreement_type->vs_agreement_type{mou,nda,commercial,revenue_share,sla};
  partner_ref_type->vs_partner_ref{crm_account,ad_partner,tenant,vendor};
  status/state->vs_lifecycle_state.
end note


