note as SALESFORCE_ACTIVITY_ALIGNMENT
  SALESFORCE-STYLE ACTIVITY MODEL
  - crm_activities is the common timeline parent.
  - crm_tasks, crm_events, email messages, call logs and notes hold subtype-specific data.
  - crm_activity_relations supports multiple WHO participants and WHAT records, including
    account, contact, lead, opportunity, contract, partnership and service case.
  - assignments, reminders, recurrence, invitee response and account/contact roles are
    explicit; no single subject_ref_id is relied upon for the complete relationship graph.
end note

